          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "nindati is the present of the root √nind, \"to blame, censure\" (MW). The root is inherited from Indo-European: MW compares Greek oneidos, \"reproach\". It is a Rigvedic verb, and it lives on as Punjabi nindṇā, \"to blame\" (CDIAL 7211)."
            }
          ]
        },
