              "text": "praśaṃsati is built on pra-, \"forth\", and the root √śaṃs, \"to recite, praise\" (MW). The root is inherited from Indo-European: MW compares Latin cēnsēre, \"to assess\", and carmen, \"song\". Its noun praśaṃsā, \"praise\", went into Bengali."
